        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2221, Solid Brass Pocket Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis door pull installs in the edge of the door to pull a sliding door out of its pocket. The Solid Brass Pocket Door Pull is a spring loaded pull lever so it automatically returns to a position that is flush with the plate when released. The 4 Inch Pocket Door Edge Pull measures 4 inches high by 3/4 inches wide. Its narrow width allows for installation on narrow or standard 1-3/8 inch wide doors.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek 2221 Door Edge Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
